# OQ-7, L §6.1 The joint model's own movements (SF-32): "A movement of the joint model's own versions into a member's
# place changes no member's answer, since the member is closed: it is booked there only where same or fulfils links it
# to the member's own movement. Otherwise it is listed in the joint model's register (left out:, §8.2), and a joint
# total over that place is a hole naming it"; L §8.1 HOLE-SAME `<movement> crosses to <member> with no link`; L §8.2
# `left out: <move>, <n> instances, first <day>`. help (50.00 PLN, 2026-05-05, a.konto to b.konto) links to nothing:
# from that day both places read in the joint model are holes naming it (kb, ka); before it, the members' own
# balances: b.konto 200 + 300 = 500.00, a.konto 500 + 4 x 1 000 - 300 = 4 200.00 (kb0, ka0); ben alone is unchanged
# (b.q). (Writer 8: was REFCORE-NOT-YET.) Round 17b: a read is a hole "from the movement's day until the member's next
# reading of the place" (neither member reads konto after 2026-05-05, so kb and ka are holes), and "Every result that
# reads the place on or after the movement's day lists it under left out:"; kb0 and ka0 read it before help's day
# and list nothing.
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "0b0615a67a4ae71646df39a5edbd8b0a4fe46b72c4f53654cfa7eaa10b6a9a81"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "4f927bb0b7b8b6a1acfc3c6b41ae7af8e9f8b78b4e5a331024f351ac66548a01"

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input jday: date
input jamt: money PLN

move help: transfers
  on jday
  leg cash from a.konto to b.konto amount jamt

version jv
  cite plan
  governs always
  known 2026-01-02
  jday = 2026-05-05 "plan"
  jamt = 50.00 PLN "plan"

ask kb: bal(b.konto, 2026-12-31)
ask kb0: bal(b.konto, 2026-04-30)
ask ka: bal(a.konto, 2026-12-31)
ask ka0: bal(a.konto, 2026-04-30)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place to_ben: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input wage_amt: money PLN
input pay_dom: int
input gift_amt: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  leg cash from world to konto amount wage_amt

move gift: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from konto to to_ben amount gift_amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  wage_amt = 1 000.00 PLN "umowa"
  pay_dom = 10 "umowa"
  gift_amt = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== ben.tally
model ben
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-05
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "umowa"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-01-01..
place from_ana: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input gift_in: money PLN
input gift_day: date

move gift_in_m: transfers
  on gift_day
  leg cash from from_ana to konto amount gift_in

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  gift_in = 300.00 PLN "plan"
  gift_day = 2026-03-15 "plan"
  opening[konto] = 200.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-12-31)
=== expect kb kb0 ka ka0 b.q
kb: ?"help crosses to b with no link" (help)
  left out: help, 1 instances, first 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-01-05
kb0: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
ka: ?"help crosses to a with no link" (help)
  left out: help, 1 instances, first 2026-05-05
  cut 2026-01-05
ka0: 4 200.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
b.q: 500.00 PLN
  cut 2026-01-05
